B.a41=new A.dh("The Midnight Meteor Shower","Although the backyard was chilly, Priya stayed wrapped in a blanket and watched the northern sky. At first, nothing moved; then a silver streak flashed above the trees. Within minutes, meteors appeared one after another, turning patience into wonder.")
B.a3X=new A.dh("Designing a Greener School","The student council studied how much paper, water, and electricity the school used each week. After comparing their notes, they proposed refill stations, recycling bins, and a lights-off reminder. Small choices, they explained, could create meaningful change.")
B.a43=new A.dh("The Puzzle in the Attic","Inside a dusty wooden box, Mateo discovered dozens of painted tiles. No instructions were included, yet each tile had a curved line along its edge. By sorting colors and matching patterns, he slowly assembled a beautiful map of an imaginary island.")
B.a42=new A.dh("A City for Pollinators","Butterflies and bees need safe places to rest and find food, even in busy neighborhoods. Residents planted native flowers in window boxes, gardens, and schoolyards. Together, these small spaces formed a colorful pathway across the city.")
B.a3U=new A.dh("The Young Inventors Fair","Teams arrived with clever machines made from gears, sensors, recycled materials, and plenty of imagination. One invention sorted pencils by color; another reminded houseplants when the soil was dry. Every project began with a problem and a curious question.")
B.a3S=new A.dh("Following the River","From a narrow mountain stream, the river gathered water and curved through forests, farms, and towns. Scientists sampled it at several locations, recording temperature and clarity. Their observations revealed how one connected waterway supported many communities.")
B.a47=new A.dh("The Community Mural","Before anyone opened a paint can, neighbors shared ideas for the empty brick wall. Their final design combined local plants, familiar buildings, and portraits of community helpers. Over several weekends, separate sketches became one enormous, welcoming picture.")
B.a3Z=new A.dh("Signals from the Sea","The research buoy measured waves, wind, and water temperature throughout the day. Each evening, it transmitted a compact report to scientists on shore. By studying those signals over time, the team could recognize patterns and improve coastal forecasts.")
